# The ROM is a build artifact: ./make.sh produces it from this tree.
*.nds
*.sav
# Local emulator SD card root. Holds converted game data, which must never be
# committed: the converter makes it from the user's own copy of Half-Life.
sdroot/
# ... and the converter's own files beside it, which the card's archives are
# made from (the stage: see README, "Converting the game").
sdroot-stage/
*.log

